        "description": "The twin towers skyline, a city viewpoint and a Hindu cave temple with a rainbow staircase.",
        "details": "The Petronas Towers have a skybridge and observation deck, with the KLCC park at their foot. Batu Caves is a limestone hill with a golden statue of Murugan and 272 steps to a cave temple, with macaques. Dress modestly at the temple, and go in the morning.",
