      "malaysia/kinabatangan": {
        "name": "Kinabatangan River wildlife cruises",
        "description": "Dawn and dusk river cruises to see proboscis monkeys, pygmy elephants and hornbills.",
        "details": "The Kinabatangan is the longest river in Sabah, and its lower reaches are a corridor of rainforest with monkeys and birds easily seen from small boats. Lodges offer morning and evening cruises and night walks. Expect humidity and rain, and bring a rain jacket.",
